			<item>
				<title>Flo&#39;s Hip Operation</title>
				<link>/2026-09-10-flos-hip-op/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/2026-09-10-flos-hip-op/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Thursday 10th September and it&amp;rsquo;s time for Flo&amp;rsquo;s first operation. We arrived in good time and were shown our room and Flo was prepped for surgery. The operation was delayed by quite sometime and Flo didn’t arrive back in the room around 23:30 fully awake and sporting a new hip and scar. Early next morning we had some physio then a visit from the doctor after which Flo was discharged, by 11:30 we were back home.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
